00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.000 line:100%
Freeze! Stop right there!

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.600 line:100%
Stay where you are!
Move again, and I'll shoot!

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.080 line:100%
Don't shoot! Please!

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.720 line:100%
We surrender!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.160 line:100%
My goodness.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:04.640 line:100%
DIE

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:24.760 line:100%
What are you laughing at?

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:26.360 line:100%
Enjoy the foot-soaking water?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.440 line:100%
Officer He. We…

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.520 line:100%
-We met before.
-We met before.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.960 line:100%
Do I know you? Did I arrest you before?

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.880 line:100%
-Yesterday afternoon. Yesterday afternoon.
-Afternoon.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.840 line:100%
-I just saw you.
-We met.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.440 line:100%
TRANSFORM BUSINESS FOR GROWTH

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.720 line:100%
You work for Jin Manshan?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.040 line:100%
Then why didn't you
tell the truth yesterday?

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.120 line:100%
Are you involved
with the missing father and daughter?

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:05.840 line:100%
Nothing to do with us!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.920 line:100%
-We just came here to take a look.
-We are just…

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:08.680 line:100%
What does that have to do with anything?

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:09.680 line:100%
-Nothing.
-Nothing.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:10.840 line:100%
Shut up!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:11.960 line:100%
One at a time.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.680 line:100%
You go first.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.120 line:100%
We… We're just…

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.760 line:100%
-We're just part-timers.
-Part-timers.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.280 line:100%
Part-timers?

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.360 line:100%
What kind of "part-timers"
walk around with tattoos

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.680 line:100%
and carry stuff like that?

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.320 line:100%
We don't know anything.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.840 line:100%
We just spent 200 yuan to get the tattoos,

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.760 line:100%
so we could go collect debts.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.200 line:100%
You came here to collect money?

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.120 line:100%
How much does the Xu family
owe Jin Manshan?

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:33.840 line:100%
Two hundred and fifty thousand.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.240 line:100%
How much did they actually borrow?

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.120 line:100%
Eight thousand.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:44.040 line:100%
You loan sharks are real math geniuses.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.120 line:100%
This isn't your first time here, is it?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.240 line:100%
Yesterday afternoon.

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:51.080 line:100%
-Afternoon.
-We came yesterday afternoon.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:56.080 line:100%
DIE

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.000 line:100%
Are you sure?

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.480 line:100%
No one is home.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.160 line:100%
What's the point of writing that?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.760 line:100%
You're so clueless.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.840 line:100%
I wrote this to show Mr. Jin.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.120 line:100%
Sling it over your shoulder. Quick.

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.920 line:20%
DAJIANCHANG NEIGHBORHOOD

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.080 line:100%
-I'm hungry.
-How about

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.760 line:100%
we go grab something to eat?

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.280 line:100%
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:45.720 line:100%
-We went out to get some tofu pudding.
-We ate tofu pudding.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.480 line:100%
-Then we came back.
-We saw the tape had been removed.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:49.760 line:100%
-We thought the family had returned.
-We thought…

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.080 line:100%
Enough.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.400 line:100%
Are you two performing crosstalk?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:53.840 line:100%
When was the last time

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.240 line:100%
the father and daughter
were seen leaving home?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.440 line:100%
People said it was the day
before Hong Kong, China's handover.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.880 line:100%
Someone saw them leave,

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.960 line:100%
-and they never came back.
-Never came back.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.920 line:100%
30TH, MONDAY

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.320 line:100%
Why did the Xu family borrow money?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.840 line:100%
-Because…
-You answer.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.600 line:100%
The daughter was devoted.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.160 line:100%
She borrowed money to treat her father.

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.880 line:100%
Her father was in poor health.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.800 line:100%
The medical bills
drained everything they had.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:23.760 line:100%
What illness?

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:25.400 line:100%
No idea.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.320 line:100%
-We don't know.
-We really don't know.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.320 line:100%
We honestly don't know.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.520 line:100%
You were carrying a gun just now.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.280 line:100%
Did you file the paperwork to borrow it?

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.040 line:100%
FOR DRAMATIC EFFECT. DO NOT IMITATE

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.160 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.240 line:100%
What are you doing exactly?

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.880 line:100%
That's pure reflex.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.760 line:100%
When criminals hear a gunshot,
they assume it's real.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.600 line:100%
What?

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.200 line:100%
Reflex.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.960 line:100%
A real cop using a fake fun?
And you're proud of it.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.600 line:100%
As long as it works.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.280 line:100%
You nearly scared me to death.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.160 line:100%
The Xu father and daughter
might've gone to relatives to dodge debt.

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.720 line:100%
I want to check their household records.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.840 line:100%
Do you know what time it is?
The registry office isn't open yet.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.080 line:100%
Two more hours. I'll wait.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.800 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:43.080 line:100%
<i>You dressed like</i>
<i>some imperial envoy on tour.</i>

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.360 line:100%
<i>Chasing suspects</i>
<i>in leather shoes and slacks?</i>

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.000 line:100%
<i>That's not practical.</i>

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.080 line:100%
Timing matters more than being early.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:29.840 line:100%
Oh my!

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.040 line:100%
He Yuanhang, what happened to you?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:41.360 line:100%
Paint. I brushed against it.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.200 line:100%
Brushed against it?

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:46.400 line:100%
Looks like you fell into a paint vat.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.160 line:100%
That's what being a detective is like.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:50.040 line:100%
Dirty, exhausting, and rough.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.600 line:100%
-You never know what tomorrow will bring.
-Go wash up.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.640 line:100%
Dad, you've changed.

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.800 line:100%
Ever since you joined
the criminal department,

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:01.040 line:100%
you've been talking big.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.680 line:100%
Kiddo, I promise you.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.680 line:100%
I'll prove it soon enough.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:12.480 line:100%
That hairstyle is cool.

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.120 line:100%
When I grow up, I want one like that too.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:28.240 line:100%
MODERN LAW ENFORCEMENT
UNWAVERING POLICE EXCELLENCE

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.959 line:100%
-Morning, Captain Zhao, Captain Qu.
-Morning.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:34.839 line:100%
Captain Zhao.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.800 line:100%
The case in Binchuan District,
where four teenagers had gone missing,

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.200 line:100%
has been going on for almost two weeks.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.800 line:100%
We still haven't found them.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.200 line:100%
All kinds of rumors are spreading online,

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.160 line:100%
and it's causing quite a stir.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.600 line:100%
-Director Zou mentioned…
-I know.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.080 line:100%
He already called me.

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:56.160 line:100%
We'll be assisting the municipal bureau
on this joint case.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:59.320 line:100%
-Qu. You take this case.
-Alright.

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.240 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.960 line:100%
Contact all stations in our jurisdiction.
Get them involved too.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.400 line:100%
No problem.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.680 line:100%
We all know each other. They'll cooperate.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.320 line:100%
Report to me immediately
when there are any solid leads.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.320 line:100%
Understood, Captain Zhao.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.520 line:100%
Captain Zhao.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.640 line:100%
-Good morning.
-Morning.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.800 line:100%
Captain Zhao, about the report
I submitted earlier,

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:19.960 line:100%
when would you have time to approve it?

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:22.800 line:100%
What report?

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:25.200 line:100%
The application for field duty.

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.280 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.120 line:100%
field work is tough,

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.720 line:100%
exhausting, and dangerous.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.360 line:100%
Captain Zhao, I'm not afraid.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:37.920 line:100%
I studied criminal investigation
for six years.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.360 line:100%
Fieldwork is exactly what I'm trained for.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:44.960 line:100%
Oh, well.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.880 line:100%
If only you showed that same dedication

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.400 line:100%
to taking care of your dad.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.000 line:100%
-Captain Zhao.
-But…

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.760 line:100%
The report you requested is ready.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.280 line:100%
Come with me.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.480 line:100%
Does Han Zi'ang have a phone or a camera?

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.800 line:100%
No.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.840 line:100%
There's not much to do at Yuanlongli.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:06.240 line:100%
People mostly go there
to take photos and videos.

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:08.280 line:100%
If your child doesn't have
a phone or a camera,

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.280 line:100%
it's unlikely he went there.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.640 line:100%
Here's what you do.
Go home and wait for now.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.240 line:100%
Maybe he skipped class
and went out to play.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:15.000 line:100%
That's impossible.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.760 line:100%
I met a psychic this morning.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.880 line:100%
He said Ang must be in Yuanlongli.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.280 line:100%
A psychic? That's all nonsense.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.040 line:100%
Why would a psychic lie?

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.960 line:100%
He promised to help me find my child.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:29.320 line:100%
Ma'am, what did this psychic look like?

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.600 line:100%
He…

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.040 line:100%
He is about this tall,

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.640 line:100%
wearing a colored shirt,
and carrying a bag.

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:36.720 line:100%
He said all the missing kids in Yuanlongli

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.040 line:100%
were found by him.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.200 line:100%
Han Zi'ang.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.760 line:100%
Come out.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.800 line:100%
Your mom's looking for you.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.360 line:100%
Now that Yuanlongli
is about to be demolished,

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.120 line:100%
everything hidden inside
will come out into the open.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:04.160 line:100%
DEMOLITION

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:20.080 line:100%
You see,
if you hadn't gone to Beijing back then,

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:22.240 line:100%
would things between you two…

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:23.520 line:100%
No.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.040 line:100%
And there's no "if".

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.600 line:100%
I've always wondered.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.880 line:100%
You two were such a good match.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.360 line:100%
What happened in the end?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.120 line:100%
Where did the trike go?

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:19.800 line:100%
What trike?

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.720 line:100%
Are you remembering it wrong?

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.200 line:100%
No way.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.800 line:100%
It was blocking the door.
I moved it myself.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.520 line:100%
Someone must've been here.

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.760 line:100%
-Let's go back and check.
-Sir.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.160 line:20%
MISSING PERSON

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.800 line:100%
You're here.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.200 line:100%
What are you doing here?

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:44.600 line:100%
What kind of question is that?
I'm here to work.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.000 line:100%
Did you track down
their household registration?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.480 line:100%
The Xu's have two relatives in Weiyang.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.840 line:100%
Xu Zhihong has a sister. Xu Meng
has an uncle on her mother's side.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.600 line:100%
XU MEIQIN'S AND QIAO GUOQIANG'S ADDRESSES

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.440 line:100%
Let's split up. Make it quick.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.600 line:100%
I don't have a brother like that.
And no niece either.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.880 line:100%
Xu Meng borrowed money from you
to treat her father, right?

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:17.880 line:100%
To be honest, in my brother's condition,

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.480 line:100%
he'd be better off dead.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:20.600 line:100%
It's done.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.920 line:100%
-Alright. Have a nice day.
-Thank you.

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:29.400 line:100%
He couldn't pay the debt,
so he kept pestering me.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:32.760 line:100%
Look around. This place is a mess.

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:35.200 line:100%
When was the last time you saw them?

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:37.680 line:100%
Last year, one night.
He suddenly had an attack.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.880 line:100%
Meng brought him over to borrow money.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.840 line:100%
Aunt.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.960 line:100%
Open the door, Aunt.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.480 line:100%
Aunt.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.600 line:100%
Aunt.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:52.320 line:100%
-Meng.
-Aunt, my dad's sick again.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:56.960 line:100%
Slow down.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.440 line:100%
Aunt, could you…

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.080 line:100%
Thank you, Aunt.

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:21.680 line:100%
Meng.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.320 line:100%
I'm planning to move away soon.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.520 line:100%
Where are you moving to?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.400 line:100%
I understand.

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.360 line:100%
I won't come again.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:48.080 line:100%
I'll find a way to pay you back.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.400 line:100%
Take this. Go to the hospital now.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.080 line:100%
Thank you, Aunt.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.720 line:100%
She's a good kid.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.680 line:100%
Definitely.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.040 line:100%
What a shame.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.480 line:100%
She got dragged down by her father.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:25.760 line:100%
To be frank,

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.720 line:100%
when I heard my brother had gone missing,

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:32.280 line:100%
I actually felt relieved.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.840 line:100%
I shouldn't have felt that way.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.760 line:100%
Life and death aren't up to us.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.880 line:100%
Not up to us?

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.640 line:100%
He brought this on himself.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.760 line:100%
He was perfectly fine before.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:48.680 line:100%
But two summers ago,

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:50.960 line:100%
he and his daughter
went to Mount Wu for a trip,

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.160 line:100%
like they were possessed.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:55.280 line:100%
They ran into an accident
in the mountains.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:17:00.280 line:100%
He fell off a cliff
and ended up like this.

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.760 line:100%
Half dead.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.680 line:100%
A mountain accident?
The Mount Wu incident?

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.919 line:20%
MAJOR MOUNTAIN ACCIDENT HIT MOUNT WU
KUNHAI CITY, YESTERDAY

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.119 line:100%
It started with heavy rain,
then thick fog.

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:13.320 line:100%
That tour group got lost
the moment they entered the mountains.

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.879 line:100%
You can imagine. In the mountains,

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.840 line:100%
there was no food, no water,

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.639 line:100%
and no one coming to help.

00:17:19.639 --> 00:17:21.399 line:100%
Many people froze to death.

00:17:21.919 --> 00:17:23.560 line:100%
My uncle was one of the lucky ones.

00:17:23.639 --> 00:17:25.080 line:100%
He made it out alive.

00:17:25.159 --> 00:17:26.399 line:100%
He might as well be dead!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.760 line:100%
That's how Xu Zhihong
ended up with his condition.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.040 line:100%
-Can I borrow this newspaper?
-Take that.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.040 line:100%
Why are you keeping
that frigging paper anyway?

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:47.400 line:100%
When was the last time you saw Xu Meng?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.120 line:100%
When?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.040 line:100%
Heaven knows how long ago!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.320 line:100%
Officer, want me to pour you some tea?

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.520 line:100%
Does anyone in your family do this too?

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:23.920 line:100%
No, I just like it.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:31.760 line:100%
Young man,

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.160 line:100%
do you think people are afraid
of dying at the end?

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.840 line:100%
I don't really know.

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:41.880 line:100%
Look at my brother-in-law.

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.360 line:100%
He can barely breathe.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.000 line:100%
Living like that is worse than dying.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.720 line:100%
So why keep him alive?

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.560 line:100%
Last winter, I cut ties with them.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.640 line:100%
Just to keep him alive,

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.120 line:100%
the father and daughter scammed people.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.280 line:100%
She even turned to prostitution
and worked as a hostess.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.280 line:100%
Anyone tied to relatives like that
is doomed.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.640 line:100%
Don't talk about Meng like that.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:00.840 line:100%
Why not?

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.520 line:100%
Didn't Xu Meng take advantage of you?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.160 line:100%
You lent her your wedding money.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.200 line:100%
She said she'd pay it back
right away. Did she?

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.680 line:100%
And your engagement fell apart.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.120 line:100%
You really don't know why?

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:28.360 line:100%
Do you know if they crossed
the wrong people?

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.640 line:100%
Probably loan sharks.

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.160 line:100%
My uncle is actually a good man.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.360 line:100%
He raised Meng all by himself.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.880 line:100%
It wasn't easy.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.520 line:100%
So Xu Zhihong was a loving father?

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.520 line:100%
Loving, you say? More like a "treasure".

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.600 line:100%
He's in that state and still not dead.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.000 line:100%
I'd say he's some treasure indeed.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.480 line:100%
Dad!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.320 line:20%
MAJOR MOUNTAIN ACCIDENT HIT MOUNT WU
KUNHAI CITY, YESTERDAY

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.040 line:20%
They survived an accident,
went into debt for treatment,

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.760 line:100%
and now someone hired a hit on them.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.400 line:100%
The Xu's really have it rough.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.520 line:100%
Let's just hope
nothing else happens to them.

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.520 line:100%
Hard to say.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.920 line:100%
From the scene at their home,
they left in a hurry.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.160 line:100%
But why would they go to Yuanlongli?

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:16.520 line:100%
And then disappear in the elevator?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.840 line:100%
Something about this doesn't add up.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.160 line:100%
Up till now,

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.440 line:100%
we still don't know how they disappeared.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:28.560 line:100%
Let's hope nothing else happens to them.

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.440 line:100%
Otherwise, this case
could drag on forever.

00:20:35.840 --> 00:20:38.280 line:100%
I'm heading to the video rental shop
Wolfie mentioned,

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.200 line:100%
see if I can dig up anything

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.360 line:100%
-about the person who hired the hit.
-Well.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:42.520 line:100%
I think we should start
with the loan shark.

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:44.680 line:100%
Jin Manshan wasn't telling
the truth yesterday.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.280 line:100%
He was definitely holding something back.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.240 line:100%
We should press him
and get the truth out of him.

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.200 line:100%
Then you go find Jin Manshan.
I'll check out the video rental shop.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:54.240 line:100%
That place is full of all kinds
of shady characters.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:56.400 line:100%
Don't scare them off.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:09.880 line:100%
Officer He.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:11.800 line:100%
Hm?

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:16.040 line:100%
Actually, we can go together.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.680 line:100%
Better to have each other's backs.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.120 line:100%
That foot bath grossed you out that much?

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:27.480 line:100%
Sure. Call me "sir", and I'll go with you.

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:33.040 line:100%
He can't take a joke.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.800 line:100%
WANXIANG VIDEO RENTAL SHOP

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.640 line:100%
CONTINUOUS SCREENINGS
NO ADDITIONAL TICKETS NEEDED

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:46.120 line:100%
RAN FANGXU POLICE ID

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.720 line:100%
Officers, this way, please.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.600 line:100%
SCREENING ROOM

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:08.360 line:100%
TOP PICKS FROM HK
ACTION-PACKED WESTERNS

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.240 line:100%
The night before last,

00:22:12.320 --> 00:22:14.520 line:100%
someone came in wearing a cap and a mask.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:15.480 line:100%
Ring a bell?

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:19.040 line:100%
So many people come and go every day.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:20.600 line:100%
How would I remember?

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:23.520 line:100%
Jin Manlang was here too.
You don't remember that either?

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:25.000 line:100%
I really don't know.

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:28.200 line:100%
We wouldn't dare mess
with those gangsters.

00:22:28.800 --> 00:22:29.640 line:100%
You're lying.

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:31.480 line:100%
No way.

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:33.960 line:100%
How would I dare lie to you officers?

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:35.680 line:100%
-You!
-Hey.

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:36.720 line:100%
Ran.

00:22:36.800 --> 00:22:37.960 line:100%
Come over.

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:49.480 line:100%
Nothing he says is true.

00:22:49.560 --> 00:22:51.520 line:100%
He's just trying to get by.

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:53.760 line:100%
Pushing him won't help.
Everyone's got their struggles.

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:01.240 line:100%
This is a murder-for-hire case.

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:02.600 line:100%
Lives are on the line.

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:05.520 line:100%
If he won't cooperate,
I'll file for an investigation right now.

00:23:05.600 --> 00:23:07.080 line:100%
Wait.

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:09.200 line:100%
Let me think.

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:11.680 line:100%
I'll think of a way.

00:23:29.560 --> 00:23:30.840 line:100%
THE PLUM IN THE GOLDEN VASE

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:36.920 line:100%
This one looks interesting.

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:40.000 line:100%
I'll take it back
and watch it at the station.

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:43.520 line:100%
It talks about human desires.

00:23:43.600 --> 00:23:44.680 line:100%
-Officer.
-What is it?

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:47.960 line:100%
Look at me. My head just cleared up.

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:51.240 line:100%
I do remember that guy wearing a mask.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:52.840 line:100%
What did he look like?

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:54.560 line:100%
Black cap, white mask. Does that help?

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:59.240 line:100%
-How tall?
-I was sitting down. Couldn't tell.

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:00.720 line:100%
What was he watching?

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:03.600 line:100%
That's the strange part.
He didn't watch anything.

00:24:03.680 --> 00:24:04.720 line:100%
He went straight to the back
after coming in.

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:05.800 line:100%
He said he was looking for the restroom.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:09.440 line:100%
Then he talked to Wolf for a bit,
took a phone call, and left.

00:24:09.520 --> 00:24:11.320 line:100%
How did he leave? Did he drive?

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:13.000 line:100%
I was sitting over there. I didn't see.

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:14.080 line:100%
You'd better be honest.

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:15.920 line:100%
I'm really good at faces.

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:18.760 line:100%
I really am.

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:24.800 line:20%
VIDEO RENTAL SHOP

00:24:35.680 --> 00:24:36.520 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:24:37.560 --> 00:24:39.720 line:100%
It won't help to worry.
Let's go find Jin Manshan.

00:24:40.760 --> 00:24:41.680 line:100%
Get in.

00:25:21.720 --> 00:25:22.800 line:100%
Mister.

00:25:24.280 --> 00:25:25.520 line:100%
What is it?

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:32.800 line:100%
Please. What do you want?

00:25:32.880 --> 00:25:34.120 line:100%
Relax.

00:25:35.480 --> 00:25:37.040 line:100%
Just want to ask about someone.

00:25:37.120 --> 00:25:39.400 line:100%
-Go on, please.
-Stay still.

00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:52.120 line:100%
So many books.

00:25:53.360 --> 00:25:55.920 line:100%
This is sold by weight.
We can get a good price for it.

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:11.560 line:100%
There's a ghost making noise.

00:26:17.160 --> 00:26:19.640 line:100%
-Where?
-Over there.

00:26:53.120 --> 00:26:54.160 line:100%
See it?

00:26:55.680 --> 00:26:58.200 line:100%
You know, my memory's sharp.

00:26:59.040 --> 00:27:01.200 line:100%
This is obviously
a drifters' resting spot.

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:03.040 line:100%
That doesn't prove anything.

00:27:03.840 --> 00:27:05.440 line:100%
Why not?

00:27:05.520 --> 00:27:08.240 line:100%
These two wooden stools
were on the 18th floor just now.

00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:16.480 line:100%
Which means someone's been tailing us.

00:27:16.560 --> 00:27:17.520 line:100%
Help!

00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:20.400 line:100%
-Help!
-Help!

00:27:21.240 --> 00:27:22.920 line:100%
-Help!
-Help!

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:25.240 line:100%
Don't come any closer!

00:27:25.880 --> 00:27:27.920 line:100%
-Help…
-Help!

00:27:28.000 --> 00:27:30.000 line:100%
Help…

00:27:30.600 --> 00:27:31.520 line:100%
Stop!

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:36.280 line:100%
Sir! Sir!

00:27:48.440 --> 00:27:49.400 line:100%
Ang!

00:27:50.400 --> 00:27:51.440 line:100%
Ang!

00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:53.640 line:100%
Ang!

00:27:54.160 --> 00:27:55.720 line:100%
Is he okay?

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:58.480 line:100%
Ms. Wang, let's send
the boy to the hospital first.

00:27:58.560 --> 00:27:59.920 line:100%
Quick. Get in.

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:02.680 line:100%
-What's going on with the victim?
-He's the suspect.

00:28:03.240 --> 00:28:04.360 line:100%
These two are the victims.

00:28:04.440 --> 00:28:05.680 line:100%
The kid attacked them with a knife.

00:28:05.760 --> 00:28:06.720 line:100%
Good thing it was dull.

00:28:07.480 --> 00:28:08.560 line:100%
Have you seen my dad?

00:28:10.240 --> 00:28:11.240 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:28:11.320 --> 00:28:14.120 line:100%
-Dad, you're hurt too?
-Just a scratch. I'm fine.

00:28:15.160 --> 00:28:17.600 line:100%
Where's Fangxu? He was just here.

00:28:24.520 --> 00:28:27.000 line:100%
-Mr. He, are you alright?
-Just superficial.

00:28:27.080 --> 00:28:28.600 line:100%
Xiaohe, take my car.

00:28:28.680 --> 00:28:29.840 line:100%
Get your dad home to rest.

00:28:30.960 --> 00:28:32.360 line:100%
I don't need you worrying about me.

00:28:33.160 --> 00:28:34.520 line:100%
Who's worrying about you?

00:28:34.600 --> 00:28:36.080 line:100%
Captain Zhao is taking us to the scene.

00:28:36.160 --> 00:28:37.280 line:100%
Stop wandering around here.

00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:40.280 line:100%
Jerk, I found the boy.

00:28:40.360 --> 00:28:41.800 line:100%
What? Are you trying to take the credit?

00:28:41.880 --> 00:28:43.480 line:100%
-Dad.
-No wonder you're bald.

00:28:44.920 --> 00:28:47.080 line:100%
Living off other people's work.

00:28:49.720 --> 00:28:50.720 line:100%
Ran!

00:28:52.440 --> 00:28:53.280 line:100%
Ran!

00:28:54.320 --> 00:28:57.000 line:100%
-Get in.
-Alright.

00:28:59.600 --> 00:29:00.440 line:100%
Let's go.

00:29:32.680 --> 00:29:33.520 line:100%
Why are we here?

00:29:34.600 --> 00:29:37.880 line:100%
Isn't Jin Manshan's men
supposed to be at Jinsha Market?

00:29:39.240 --> 00:29:41.360 line:100%
Being a beat officer takes skill.

00:29:41.440 --> 00:29:44.080 line:100%
These 20 years weren't for nothing.

00:29:54.320 --> 00:29:56.800 line:100%
LEIGONG STREET

00:30:03.040 --> 00:30:04.480 line:100%
They've got a lookout.

00:30:09.160 --> 00:30:11.000 line:100%
Play drunk. Can you do that?

00:30:19.000 --> 00:30:21.720 line:100%
-I want more.
-Slow down.

00:30:21.800 --> 00:30:24.680 line:100%
-Another carton.
-Watch the step. Slow down.

00:30:24.760 --> 00:30:26.720 line:100%
I can drink another carton of beer.

00:30:27.440 --> 00:30:28.480 line:100%
Wait.

00:30:28.560 --> 00:30:30.320 line:100%
Why don't we just go in?

00:30:30.400 --> 00:30:31.240 line:100%
Why make it so complicated?

00:30:31.840 --> 00:30:33.840 line:100%
It's a small gambling den.

00:30:33.920 --> 00:30:35.960 line:100%
I busted it before.

00:30:37.040 --> 00:30:39.120 line:100%
This time, we'll just scare them a bit.

00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:42.240 line:100%
-Slow down.
-I'm fine.

00:30:49.400 --> 00:30:51.000 line:100%
His legs.

00:30:57.280 --> 00:30:58.720 line:100%
Right here.

00:31:03.640 --> 00:31:05.720 line:100%
Why is it you again, Officer He?

00:31:06.680 --> 00:31:07.640 line:100%
Cut the crap.

00:31:07.720 --> 00:31:08.880 line:100%
Is Jin Manshan inside?

00:31:10.200 --> 00:31:11.080 line:100%
How many people?

00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:13.720 line:100%
-Over 20.
-More than 20?

00:31:21.400 --> 00:31:22.240 line:100%
Where are you going?

00:31:22.320 --> 00:31:23.360 line:100%
Too many of them.

00:31:23.440 --> 00:31:25.200 line:100%
We can't just rush in.
I need to check the layout first.

00:31:36.680 --> 00:31:38.400 line:100%
Business looks pretty good lately.

00:31:38.920 --> 00:31:39.960 line:100%
That's all the bosses.

00:31:40.040 --> 00:31:42.840 line:100%
I just watch the door and keep lookout.

00:31:42.920 --> 00:31:46.040 line:100%
Officer He,
please don't tell Mr. Jin it's me.

00:31:46.120 --> 00:31:49.160 line:100%
You've got some nerve
to bargain with me, huh?

00:31:49.240 --> 00:31:50.600 line:100%
If you have time, read a book.

00:31:50.680 --> 00:31:52.520 line:100%
Or get a proper job in Guangzhou.

00:31:52.600 --> 00:31:54.520 line:100%
Stop hanging around with these people.

00:31:54.600 --> 00:31:56.760 line:100%
-Got it?
-Got it, Officer He.

00:32:04.440 --> 00:32:05.360 line:100%
Listen up.

00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:07.960 line:100%
When you go back in,
as soon as you hear a gunshot,

00:32:08.040 --> 00:32:09.880 line:100%
shout "police are coming" four more times.

00:32:09.960 --> 00:32:11.760 line:100%
Then hide. Stay out of sight
for a few days.

00:32:11.840 --> 00:32:13.240 line:100%
When you come out,
just say you got detained.

00:32:13.320 --> 00:32:14.680 line:100%
Understand?

00:32:14.760 --> 00:32:16.640 line:100%
Officer He, you brought a gun?

00:32:16.720 --> 00:32:17.560 line:100%
Mm.

00:32:17.640 --> 00:32:19.000 line:100%
That's intense.

00:32:19.080 --> 00:32:21.000 line:100%
Stop talking and move.

00:32:27.080 --> 00:32:29.200 line:100%
There's a trash bin by the back door.

00:32:29.280 --> 00:32:32.360 line:100%
I'll wait there
and catch anyone who slips out.

00:32:32.440 --> 00:32:35.080 line:100%
You're taking the lead today.
Can you handle it?

00:32:35.160 --> 00:32:36.680 line:100%
Don't just curry favor
with others all the time.

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:40.240 line:100%
If I hadn't carried his legs just now,
would you have handled it alone?

00:32:41.400 --> 00:32:43.000 line:100%
Cut it out.

00:32:43.080 --> 00:32:44.960 line:100%
Open fire when I'm in position.

00:32:46.920 --> 00:32:49.280 line:100%
-What now?
-I've never seen Jin Manshan.

00:32:49.360 --> 00:32:50.720 line:100%
What does he look like?

00:32:51.240 --> 00:32:54.280 line:100%
Big gold chain around his neck.
Two gold teeth.

00:32:56.560 --> 00:32:58.240 line:100%
Big gold chain. Gold teeth.

00:33:17.360 --> 00:33:18.760 line:100%
Police are here!

00:33:20.040 --> 00:33:22.720 line:100%
Police are here! Police!

00:33:22.800 --> 00:33:24.280 line:100%
Police!

00:33:24.360 --> 00:33:26.320 line:100%
Police are here!

00:33:43.200 --> 00:33:44.840 line:100%
-Police are coming!
-Police are coming!

00:33:44.920 --> 00:33:47.560 line:100%
-Run quickly. Police are coming!
-Police are here!

00:33:47.640 --> 00:33:49.960 line:100%
-Run!
-Run quickly!

00:33:50.040 --> 00:33:51.360 line:100%
Move it now!

00:33:52.400 --> 00:33:53.400 line:100%
<i>Big gold chain. Gold teeth.</i>

00:34:13.479 --> 00:34:14.519 line:100%
Jin Manshan!

00:34:15.160 --> 00:34:16.880 line:100%
Not me. You got the wrong person.

00:34:28.080 --> 00:34:29.720 line:100%
Police! Stay put!

00:34:32.720 --> 00:34:34.600 line:100%
Stop running! Stand right there!

00:34:47.720 --> 00:34:49.840 line:100%
Jin Manshan, stop!

00:34:49.920 --> 00:34:52.120 line:100%
He Yuanhang! He Yuanhang!

00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:54.959 line:100%
He Yuanhang!

00:35:00.280 --> 00:35:01.400 line:100%
Stop running!

00:35:12.200 --> 00:35:14.600 line:100%
Officer He, what is this?

00:35:14.680 --> 00:35:15.960 line:100%
Why are you doing this?

00:35:16.040 --> 00:35:18.480 line:100%
Also, what if the lamp post
leaks electricity?

00:35:18.560 --> 00:35:19.600 line:100%
Cut the nonsense.

00:35:19.680 --> 00:35:21.600 line:100%
Don't tell me you have no idea
why you're being cuffed.

00:35:21.680 --> 00:35:24.040 line:100%
Yesterday afternoon,
when I asked about Xu Meng,

00:35:24.120 --> 00:35:25.240 line:100%
why didn't you say anything?

00:35:25.320 --> 00:35:29.040 line:100%
Officer He, I don't follow.

00:35:29.120 --> 00:35:30.480 line:100%
Who is Xu Meng?

00:35:30.560 --> 00:35:32.320 line:100%
She borrowed 8,000 from you.

00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:34.120 line:100%
It has grown to 250,000 with interest.

00:35:34.200 --> 00:35:35.840 line:100%
Does that jog your memory?

00:35:35.920 --> 00:35:37.320 line:100%
I've got a lot of borrowers.

00:35:37.920 --> 00:35:40.520 line:100%
I don't remember small fry like that.

00:35:40.600 --> 00:35:43.320 line:100%
I only deal with big clients.

00:35:43.400 --> 00:35:44.840 line:100%
Then why did you have
someone watching her house?

00:35:44.920 --> 00:35:47.800 line:100%
Young man, you're really confusing me.

00:35:47.880 --> 00:35:50.120 line:100%
I don't even know if Xu Meng
is a man or a woman.

00:35:50.200 --> 00:35:51.960 line:100%
Why would I have someone watch her?

00:35:57.560 --> 00:35:59.920 line:100%
Here. Take a look. Recognize this?

00:36:01.840 --> 00:36:03.920 line:100%
I really have no idea.

00:36:04.000 --> 00:36:07.440 line:100%
My guys handle small loans like 8,000.

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:11.640 line:100%
This wrench owes me money
and still runs off.

00:36:13.960 --> 00:36:15.560 line:100%
Watch your mouth.

00:36:15.640 --> 00:36:17.240 line:100%
She owes money and skips out.

00:36:17.320 --> 00:36:19.400 line:100%
Why should I respect her?
Did she respect me?

00:36:19.480 --> 00:36:20.360 line:100%
It's not even 10,000.

00:36:20.440 --> 00:36:23.040 line:100%
She could've paid it back somehow.

00:36:23.120 --> 00:36:26.640 line:100%
-Wrench. I'll catch her one day…
-Can't you talk without swearing?

00:36:26.720 --> 00:36:27.840 line:100%
Huh?

00:36:28.960 --> 00:36:30.320 line:100%
There you go again.

00:36:37.400 --> 00:36:38.400 line:100%
You!

00:36:39.560 --> 00:36:42.400 line:100%
Officer He, you're done asking.

00:36:42.480 --> 00:36:43.800 line:100%
Let me ask you something.

00:36:45.920 --> 00:36:49.120 line:100%
What did Jin Manlang do?

00:36:49.200 --> 00:36:50.920 line:100%
Are you sure you don't know?

00:36:53.360 --> 00:36:56.480 line:100%
Did that idiot run his mouth,
saying he killed someone?

00:36:57.200 --> 00:36:58.280 line:100%
Don't believe him.

00:36:58.360 --> 00:37:00.240 line:100%
He's been a coward since he was a kid.

00:37:00.320 --> 00:37:02.400 line:100%
Too scared to kill a chicken,
and he talks about murder?

00:37:02.480 --> 00:37:04.080 line:100%
He's just bluffing.

00:37:06.120 --> 00:37:07.800 line:100%
You don't know your brother very well.

00:37:16.320 --> 00:37:17.440 line:100%
Jin Manshan,

00:37:17.520 --> 00:37:19.320 line:100%
you assaulted a police officer.

00:37:19.400 --> 00:37:21.040 line:100%
I could detain you for that.

00:37:21.880 --> 00:37:22.960 line:100%
But listen.

00:37:24.200 --> 00:37:27.080 line:100%
If you can help me find out
what else the father and daughter

00:37:27.160 --> 00:37:29.480 line:100%
were involved in,
besides borrowing from you,

00:37:29.560 --> 00:37:31.560 line:100%
we'll count it as making up for it.

00:37:31.640 --> 00:37:33.000 line:100%
Do you get what I mean?

00:37:33.680 --> 00:37:34.560 line:100%
Yes.

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:43.160 line:100%
-Thank you.
-Hands.

00:37:44.480 --> 00:37:45.480 line:100%
Don't forget that.

00:38:05.920 --> 00:38:07.080 line:100%
Where are we going?

00:38:08.280 --> 00:38:09.560 line:100%
I'll drop you back at the dorm.

00:38:11.200 --> 00:38:12.520 line:100%
Let me off at a bus stop.

00:38:13.760 --> 00:38:16.000 line:100%
It's late. There are no buses now.

00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:24.480 line:100%
I've noticed you've been off today.

00:38:25.400 --> 00:38:27.320 line:100%
I told you. Lack of sleep can mess you up.

00:38:27.400 --> 00:38:28.720 line:100%
You never listen.

00:38:28.800 --> 00:38:31.440 line:100%
Not enough sleep affects your judgment

00:38:31.520 --> 00:38:32.880 line:100%
and makes you irritable.

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:36.080 line:100%
He was being disrespectful.
He had it coming.

00:38:49.360 --> 00:38:51.880 line:100%
Pass me the stuff in the door handle.

00:39:00.240 --> 00:39:01.280 line:100%
Stay-awake kit.

00:39:02.280 --> 00:39:03.800 line:100%
My daughter got it for me.

00:39:09.000 --> 00:39:10.440 line:100%
Your daughter sounds thoughtful.

00:39:11.480 --> 00:39:13.000 line:100%
More than that.

00:39:13.520 --> 00:39:14.520 line:100%
Want to try?

00:39:24.040 --> 00:39:25.920 line:100%
Her teachers all say

00:39:26.440 --> 00:39:28.720 line:100%
she takes after me.

00:39:29.480 --> 00:39:31.080 line:100%
Quick-witted.

00:39:31.160 --> 00:39:33.400 line:100%
The only problem is she's a bit stubborn.

00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:35.600 line:100%
She's great at sports

00:39:35.680 --> 00:39:37.440 line:100%
and loves figuring things out.

00:39:37.520 --> 00:39:38.680 line:100%
Brains and brawn.

00:39:39.200 --> 00:39:40.280 line:100%
Just like me.

00:39:41.160 --> 00:39:44.360 line:100%
Do you think I should
let her join the police like me,

00:39:44.440 --> 00:39:46.840 line:100%
or go into finance like her mom?

00:39:47.520 --> 00:39:49.040 line:100%
Don't mind me talking so much.

00:39:49.120 --> 00:39:50.920 line:100%
I'm driving at night.

00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:52.680 line:100%
Talking keeps me awake.

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:56.160 line:100%
It's fine. Go on.

00:39:56.240 --> 00:39:59.080 line:100%
Don't let me do the talking.
You say something too.

00:40:01.520 --> 00:40:02.920 line:100%
Why did you come to Weiyang?

00:40:03.680 --> 00:40:05.240 line:100%
My mom got married. I came with her.

00:40:06.960 --> 00:40:09.440 line:100%
Right. You didn't finish
your story last time.

00:40:09.960 --> 00:40:12.120 line:100%
What about you? What does your family do?

00:40:19.680 --> 00:40:21.280 line:100%
Had a falling-out with them?

00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:26.880 line:100%
You young people live so far from home.

00:40:27.640 --> 00:40:30.320 line:100%
Your parents worry and nag a little.

00:40:30.400 --> 00:40:32.080 line:100%
That's normal.

00:40:34.720 --> 00:40:36.040 line:100%
They passed away.

00:41:23.680 --> 00:41:24.680 line:100%
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:41:29.640 --> 00:41:30.800 line:100%
Speak up.

00:41:30.880 --> 00:41:33.880 line:100%
Mr. Jin, we were thinking
of staking out her place

00:41:33.960 --> 00:41:35.200 line:100%
and handling it ourselves.

00:41:35.280 --> 00:41:36.320 line:100%
Handling it yourselves?

00:41:37.280 --> 00:41:38.320 line:100%
So, your solution

00:41:38.400 --> 00:41:41.640 line:100%
is to let the police trace it back to me?

00:41:42.480 --> 00:41:43.520 line:100%
-No. It's not like that.
-Mr. Jin.

00:41:43.600 --> 00:41:45.160 line:100%
Mr. Jin. Mr. Jin.

00:41:46.520 --> 00:41:48.080 line:100%
Mr. Jin, I brought him here.

00:41:48.160 --> 00:41:49.640 line:100%
Morning, Mr. Jin.

00:41:50.640 --> 00:41:51.680 line:100%
Get lost.

00:41:53.960 --> 00:41:55.000 line:100%
Thank you.

00:41:55.080 --> 00:41:56.520 line:100%
-Sit.
-Let's sit.

00:41:58.840 --> 00:42:01.480 line:100%
What is the situation inside?
What did he say?

00:42:01.560 --> 00:42:03.720 line:100%
Wolf is doing fine in there.
Food is decent.

00:42:03.800 --> 00:42:06.440 line:100%
When he first got locked up,
he was bragging.

00:42:06.520 --> 00:42:07.400 line:100%
He said he took out two people.

00:42:10.000 --> 00:42:12.520 line:100%
How do you know he was bluffing?

00:42:12.600 --> 00:42:15.160 line:100%
Mr. Jin, you know my nickname.

00:42:15.240 --> 00:42:16.280 line:100%
Sharp Ears.

00:42:16.360 --> 00:42:19.280 line:100%
When he first went in,
he clung to the bars and refused to move.

00:42:19.360 --> 00:42:21.040 line:100%
He kept crying and told the warden

00:42:21.120 --> 00:42:22.680 line:100%
that he didn't kill anyone.

00:42:22.760 --> 00:42:24.240 line:100%
He only slaughtered a few chickens.

00:42:24.960 --> 00:42:25.800 line:100%
Are you sure?

00:42:25.880 --> 00:42:28.240 line:100%
Mr. Jin, I was locked up
for pickpocketing.

00:42:28.320 --> 00:42:30.400 line:100%
If Wolf had killed someone,
he wouldn't be in the same place as me.

00:42:33.920 --> 00:42:36.160 line:100%
You know the law pretty well.

00:42:37.040 --> 00:42:38.160 line:100%
Thank you, Mr. Jin.

00:42:38.960 --> 00:42:39.880 line:100%
By the way,

00:42:40.400 --> 00:42:42.320 line:100%
the one who hired him,

00:42:44.040 --> 00:42:44.880 line:100%
any news?

00:42:44.960 --> 00:42:47.040 line:100%
Mr. Jin, I've sent people
to track him down.

00:42:49.480 --> 00:42:51.040 line:100%
That dickhead.

00:42:53.040 --> 00:42:54.840 line:100%
He set Manlang up.

00:42:55.520 --> 00:42:56.680 line:100%
I'll make sure he pays for it.

00:42:56.760 --> 00:42:58.200 line:100%
Yeah. Make him pay.

00:42:59.200 --> 00:43:00.040 line:100%
Mr. Jin.

00:43:02.160 --> 00:43:03.200 line:100%
What is it?

00:43:04.480 --> 00:43:06.360 line:100%
The punk who set Wolf up

00:43:06.440 --> 00:43:07.480 line:100%
has been found.

00:43:08.880 --> 00:43:09.840 line:100%
Who is it?

00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:12.520 line:100%
The video rental shop owner
didn't recognize him,

00:43:12.600 --> 00:43:13.640 line:100%
but he remembers the car.

00:43:14.240 --> 00:43:16.680 line:100%
A Mercedes. Plate ending in 688.

00:43:19.000 --> 00:43:20.560 line:100%
688.

00:45:04.080 --> 00:45:07.760 line:100%
PARKING GARAGE EXIT